                        "entry_id": "9a24d7dd-742a-3a9f-9612-0d8a6cd0f75d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A newt, especially a smooth newt (Lissotriton vulgaris, syn. Triturus punctatus), of Europe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "417046c4-f894-425a-b267-cfad09632984",
                                "sense_id": "615ddeb4-1f96-3760-81d9-0b3338b4c4d5",
                                "text": "Only these marishes and myrie bogs, / In which the fearefull ewftes do build their bowres, / Yeeld me an hostry mongst the croking frogs […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e71d8a55-a034-410f-8e8a-dccbdbb47bfe",
                                "sense_id": "615ddeb4-1f96-3760-81d9-0b3338b4c4d5",
                                "text": "How did he like it when the live creatures\nTickled and toused and browsed him all over,\nAnd worm, slug, eft, with serious features\nCame in, each one, for his right of trover?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
